# EXPECT: may only be typed with classes declared
# An individual typed with a class that the T-Box does not declare.
@prefix o4de: <http://www.zt4swe.io/o4de#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
o4de:BadThing a owl:NamedIndividual, o4de:NoSuchClass ; rdfs:label "Bad thing" .
